### GET request to example server
GET https://examples.http-client.intellij.net/get
    ?generated-in=IntelliJ IDEA

### =========================
### USER
### =========================

### Get all users
GET http://localhost:8080/users

### Get one user
GET http://localhost:8080/users/mariemb005

### Create user
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "meary2005",
  "email": "mea@example.com",
  "password": "1234"
}

### Update user
PUT http://localhost:8080/users/mimi4545
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "meark47",
  "email": "newemail@example.com",
  "password": "5678",
  "confirmPassword": "5678",
  "image": "meary.png"
}

### Delete user
DELETE http://localhost:8080/users/mearo2005



### =========================
### WORK
### =========================

### Get all works
GET http://localhost:8080/works

### Get one work
GET http://localhost:8080/works/11

### Create work
POST http://localhost:8080/works
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Hobbit",
  "image": "hobbit.jpg",
  "originalPubYear": 1937
}

### Update work
PUT http://localhost:8080/works/14
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Hobbit Updated",
  "image": "new-image.jpg",
  "originalPubYear": 1937
}

### Delete work
DELETE http://localhost:8080/works/11



